<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders-for-protection-warrior-tank">Shoulders for Protection Warrior Tank</h4>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65027/pauldrons-of-the-apocalypse">
<img alt="Pauldrons of the Apocalypse" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pauldrons of the Apocalypse</span></a> are naturally the best pre-raid shoulders as the only ilvl 372 item available. Although they are merely a sidegrade to the BoE <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59901/heaving-plates-of-protection">
<img alt="Heaving Plates of Protection" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_92.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heaving Plates of Protection</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67144/pauldrons-of-edward-the-odd">
<img alt="Pauldrons of Edward the Odd" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_raidpaladin_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pauldrons of Edward the Odd</span></a> due to their lack of mastery, so you can save some <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> if the alternatives aren't too expensive on the auction house.<br/>Both are much better than the ilvl 359 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60331/earthen-shoulderguards">
<img alt="Earthen Shoulderguards" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Earthen Shoulderguards</span></a> with mediocre secondary stats so don't waste your <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> on the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64316/mantle-of-the-forlorn-protector">
<img alt="Mantle of the Forlorn Protector" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_22.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mantle of the Forlorn Protector</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69573/pauldrons-of-sacrifice">
<img alt="Pauldrons of Sacrifice" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_84.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pauldrons of Sacrifice</span></a> added with Phase 2 are a close third choice thanks to great tank stats only with a slightly lower item level. The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69582/skullpiercer-pauldrons">
<img alt="Skullpiercer Pauldrons" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_81.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Skullpiercer Pauldrons</span></a> are merely a sidegrade compared to blue ilvl 346 alternatives despite their higher item level due to undesirable DPS-oriented stats.<br/>
<br/>An easier pair of shoulders to farm before stepping into T11 raids are the 346 <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56452/earthshape-pauldrons">
<img alt="Earthshape Pauldrons" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Earthshape Pauldrons</span></a>, with a perfect stats distribution for a tank. Other 346 shoulders <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56318/razs-pauldrons">
<img alt="Raz's Pauldrons" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Raz's Pauldrons</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63470/missing-diplomats-pauldrons">
<img alt="Missing Diplomat's Pauldrons" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Missing Diplomat's Pauldrons</span></a> are good alternatives with baseline mastery, albeit with a less valuable secondary stat to reforge.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Inscription</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62333/greater-inscription-of-unbreakable-quartz">
<img alt="Greater Inscription of Unbreakable Quartz" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_crystal_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greater Inscription of Unbreakable Quartz</span></a>
