<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="back-for-protection-warrior-tank">Back for Protection Warrior Tank</h4>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69878/permafrost-cape">
<img alt="Permafrost Cape" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrowncloak.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Permafrost Cape</span></a> <b>-of the Bedrock</b> or <b>-of the Rockslab</b> — which can be randomly acquired from the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=232957/satchel-of-the-permafrost-cape">
<img alt="Satchel of the Permafrost Cape" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bag_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Satchel of the Permafrost Cape</span></a> bought for 12 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> — is by far the best pre-raid cloak. With 2 chances out of 3 to get a usable random enchantment from the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=232957/satchel-of-the-permafrost-cape">
<img alt="Satchel of the Permafrost Cape" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bag_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Satchel of the Permafrost Cape</span></a>, the odds are pretty good.<br/>
<br/>In the meantime, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71270/mantle-of-patience">
<img alt="Mantle of Patience" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cape_firelands_fireset_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mantle of Patience</span></a>, available as a reward for completing the <a class="icontiny" data-entity="quest" data-game="wow" data-type="quest" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/quest=29331/elemental-bonds-the-vow">
<img alt="Elemental Bonds: The Vow" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/quest-start.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Elemental Bonds: The Vow</span></a> questline introduced with the <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5723/firelands">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Firelands</span></a> raid, is a great second choice and the first upgrade to the trusty <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62383/wrap-of-the-great-turtle">
<img alt="Wrap of the Great Turtle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_tank_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wrap of the Great Turtle</span></a> from Phase 1. It has higher primary stats thanks to its higher item level, on top of perfect secondary stats for a tank.<ul></ul>
<b>Recommended BiS Cloak Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74234/enchant-cloak-protection">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Protection</span></a>
