<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="chest-for-protection-warrior-tank">Chest for Protection Warrior Tank</h4>The T12 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70945/chestguard-of-the-molten-giant">
<img alt="Chestguard of the Molten Giant" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raidwarrior_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chestguard of the Molten Giant</span></a> is technically the best chest piece available outside of raids and can be acquired with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>. However, the chest is the least desirable part of the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item-set=1018">T12 Protection Warrior set</a> and ultimately the slot you will want to use an off-set item in for your P3 BiS including raid items. For this reason, I would recommend buying this item last, or to skip it entirely if you don't want to waste <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>.<br/>
<br/>Alternatively, the T11 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60329/earthen-chestguard">
<img alt="Earthen Chestguard" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Earthen Chestguard</span></a> is a great chestpiece and the first item you should purchase with your <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a>. It comes with perfect secondary stats, which puts it far ahead of the other pre-raid alternatives below. If you plan to purchase the T11 gloves <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60332/earthen-handguards">
<img alt="Earthen Handguards" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_plate_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Earthen Handguards</span></a> as well with your <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a>, these two are the ideal combo to unlock the first <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item-set=943">T11 set bonus</a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Chest Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74251/enchant-chest-greater-stamina">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Chest - Greater Stamina</span></a>
