<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="hands-for-protection-warrior-tank">Hands for Protection Warrior Tank</h4>The <span class="c1">Protection</span> <a class="icontiny c1" data-entity="class" data-game="wow" data-type="class" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/class=1/warrior">
<img alt="Warrior" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_warrior.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Warrior</span></a> ilvl 378 T12 gloves <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70943/handguards-of-the-molten-giant">
<img alt="Handguards of the Molten Giant" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_plate_raidwarrior_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Handguards of the Molten Giant</span></a> are the best gloves available outside of raid for <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>. Similarly to the T11 gloves, they come with perfect secondary stats for a tank and will be later upgraded to <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71605">ilvl 391</a> in your P3 BiS set so they are a worthy investment. However, if you find yourself limited on <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>, you may prefer to buy the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70942">T12 legs</a> first instead and stick to the T11 gloves available for <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a>.<br/>
<br/>The <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item-set=943">ilvl 359 T11</a> gloves <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60332/earthen-handguards">
<img alt="Earthen Handguards" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_plate_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Earthen Handguards</span></a> are the next best thing and a big upgrade over the ilvl 346 alternatives so they should be your first purchase with your <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a> paired with the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60329/earthen-chestguard">
<img alt="Earthen Chestguard" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Earthen Chestguard</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>Phase 2 introduced the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69619/bone-plate-handguards">
<img alt="Bone Plate Handguards" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_67.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bone Plate Handguards</span></a> which are only a minor upgrade over the blue ilvl 346 alternatives due to the lack of mastery and poor gem socket, and way worse than the T11 gloves.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Glove Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74255/enchant-gloves-greater-mastery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Greater Mastery</span></a>
