<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="feet-for-protection-warrior-tank">Feet for Protection Warrior Tank</h4>The ilvl 379 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60229/war-torn-crushers">
<img alt="War-Torn Crushers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">War-Torn Crushers</span></a> — originally from <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=45213/sinestra">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sinestra</span></a> but now sold for 80 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> — are an amazing upgrade, on par with ilvl 391 boots from heroic <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5723/firelands">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Firelands</span></a> thanks to their additional gem socket over the competition at no cost to the total item budget for being a <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=45213/sinestra">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sinestra</span></a> drop. <br/>
<br/>In the meantime, the ilvl 365 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70108/pyrelord-greaves">
<img alt="Pyrelord Greaves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_mail_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pyrelord Greaves</span></a> sold by <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=52822/zenvorka">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Zen'Vorka</span></a> are a good pick-up if you already grinded the <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5733/molten-front">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Molten Front</span></a> zone ahead of Phase 3 to unlock the vendors. That being said, they are only a small upgrade over the more easily accessed ilvl 359 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62432/gryphon-riders-boots">
<img alt="Gryphon Rider's Boots" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gryphon Rider's Boots</span></a> due to a bad gem socket and lack of mastery.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Feet Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74253/enchant-boots-lavawalker">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Lavawalker</span></a>
