<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Protection Warrior Tank</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="neck-for-protection-warrior-tank">Neck for Protection Warrior Tank</h4>Similarly to the boots, the ilvl 379 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60227/caelestraszs-will">
<img alt="Caelestrasz's Will" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_46.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Caelestrasz's Will</span></a> — originally from <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=45213/sinestra">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sinestra</span></a> but now sold for 80 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> — is head and shoulders above the competition thanks to its additional gem socket free of charge on the total item budget. <br/>
<br/>Alternatively, you may prefer to gamble on the cheaper <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=232958/satchel-of-the-permafrost-choker">
<img alt="Satchel of the Permafrost Choker" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bag_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Satchel of the Permafrost Choker</span></a> for 2 chances out of 3 to receive a <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69883/permafrost-choker">
<img alt="Permafrost Choker" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrownnecklacea.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Permafrost Choker</span></a> <b>-of the Rockslab</b> or <b>-of the Bedrock</b> for only 12 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a>. While it's ~12% fewer stats than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60227/caelestraszs-will">
<img alt="Caelestrasz's Will" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_46.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Caelestrasz's Will</span></a>, it's also only 15% of the <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> cost.<br/>
<br/>Whatever you decide, stay away from the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65025/rage-of-ages">
<img alt="Rage of Ages" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea8.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rage of Ages</span></a> that offers mediocre stats for 50 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> compared to the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69883/permafrost-choker">
<img alt="Permafrost Choker" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrownnecklacea.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Permafrost Choker</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>In the meantime, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70107/fireheart-necklace">
<img alt="Fireheart Necklace" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_neck_hyjaldaily_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fireheart Necklace</span></a> — sold by <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=52822/zenvorka">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Zen'Vorka</span></a> who also sells pre-raid boots — is a decent alternative if you grinded the <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5733/molten-front">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Molten Front</span></a> ahead of Phase 3. Despite the more DPS-oriented secondary stats, it is still an upgrade to the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69635/amulet-of-protection">
<img alt="Amulet of Protection" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Amulet of Protection</span></a> from Phase 2 thanks to its higher level providing a significant boost in stamina and mastery. It is also less elusive than the rare <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69635/amulet-of-protection">
<img alt="Amulet of Protection" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Amulet of Protection</span></a> that has 1 chance out of 6 to drop when you get the correct mini-boss out of 4 to spawn in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=1977/zulgurub">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Zul'Gurub</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
