<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shields-for-protection-warrior-tank">Shields for Protection Warrior Tank</h4>If you grinded <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=794/archaeology">
<img alt="Archaeology" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Archaeology</span></a> during the pre-patch and unlocked the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69764/extinct-turtle-shell">
<img alt="Extinct Turtle Shell" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shield_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Extinct Turtle Shell</span></a>, you already own the best pre-raid shield and are set until heroic raid drops. Congratulations!<br/>If you haven't been so lucky, any of the other ilvl 359 shields will do since they all have similar stats within a 0.1% delta, i.e the World Drop BoE <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67145/blockades-lost-shield">
<img alt="Blockade's Lost Shield" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shield_grimbatolraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blockade's Lost Shield</span></a> or the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59444/akmin-kurai-dominions-shield">
<img alt="Akmin-Kurai, Dominion's Shield" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shield_bwdraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Akmin-Kurai, Dominion's Shield</span></a> available for 20 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a>.<br/>The more expensive <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=164/blacksmithing">
<img alt="Blacksmithing" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_blacksmithing.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blacksmithing</span></a> craft <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=55069/elementium-earthguard">
<img alt="Elementium Earthguard" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shield_grimbatolraid_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Elementium Earthguard</span></a> is ever so slightly better thanks to its additional gem socket to reach higher stamina, but only by a 0.7% difference so it's up to you to decide if you want to spend gold on this craft for such a tiny upgrade. <br/>
<br/>Phase 2 introduces the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69629/shield-of-the-blood-god">
<img alt="Shield of the Blood God" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shield_zulgurub_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shield of the Blood God</span></a>, with excellent stats similar to the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69764/extinct-turtle-shell">
<img alt="Extinct Turtle Shell" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shield_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Extinct Turtle Shell</span></a>, only with a lower item level putting it right in the middle between the ilvl 346 and the ilvl 359 shields.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended Shield Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74226/enchant-shield-mastery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Shield - Mastery</span></a>
